    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i've been having this weird heavy feeling in my jaw and my neck lately. it's not like a sharp pain or anything, just kind of a dull ache that comes and goes while i'm just sitting around. it doesn't even feel like it's in my chest so i'm thinking it might just be stress or maybe a bad tooth or something? what do u think?",
